      pursuing the player, calculating attack types depending on range.","comment":null,"color":{"r":0.0,"g":0.0,"b":0.0,"a":1.0},"guid":"9631a8ea-3873-4fe9-ba34-226317eabdd9","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.GraphGroup"},{"position":{"xMin":-219.0,"yMin":-339.0,"xMax":2610.647,"yMax":693.8054},"label":"Randomize
      a float between the range of attack odds. Choose an attack based on the results,
      and then cue it.","comment":null,"color":{"r":0.0,"g":0.0,"b":0.0,"a":1.0},"guid":"3f2d333b-9755-416f-9c85-5672398ec5dc","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.GraphGroup"},{"position":{"xMin":2195.0,"yMin":-77.0,"xMax":2373.0,"yMax":158.0},"title":"ATTACK
      ODDS:","body":"- PHASE 1 -\nN/A: 1.0f, ID = 2\r\nSlam : 0.05f, ID = 1\r\nCharge
      : 0.03f, ID= 0 \n\n- PHASE 3 -\nN/A: 1.0f, ID = 2\n1 Rock: 0.666666f, ID =
      1\n3 Rocks: 0.333333f, ID = 0\n\nCheck to make sure the lists are correct in
      the Attack Phase!","colorTheme":"Classic","guid":"e22b9e49-969f-4cb9-a3dc-0b6ff3145f70","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.StickyNote"},{"position":{"xMin":1442.0,"yMin":326.0,"xMax":1675.0,"yMax":441.0},"title":"LRAC
      Outputs","body":"If the Attack ID is the same as the AttackOddsRange count
      (the max value of the list), the boss does nothing and loops its pursuit. This
      prevents a value over the list length of possible attacks from passing in.","colorTheme":"Classic","guid":"7ab77051-27a1-458e-9100-e4dda8fa6ec7","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.StickyNote"},{"position":{"xMin":344.0,"yMin":-92.0,"xMax":482.0,"yMax":172.0},"title":"FRC","body":"In
      the old boss fight, jumping from Close Range to Long Range would preserve the
      Close Range timer, ending the Long Range timer if it was past 2 seconds. This
      is emulated with the FRC bool changing the timer to a small decimal rather
      than resuming it.","colorTheme":"Classic","guid":"ca76b200-9a88-4e62-b78d-ae732b0e0ee3","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.StickyNote"}],"$version":"A"}},"isStart":false,"position":{"x":-259.0,"y":-86.0},"width":170.0,"guid":"8c171fd8-0c4d-4e4d-9fd0-cf561944f91c","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.FlowState","$id":"159"},{"nest":{"source":"Embed","macro":null,"embed":{"title":"Phase
